 "answer": {
  "answer": "The goal was not met: none of the 5 cases was confirmed. One setting comes close. On scene 19f339ba, with the car 2 s earlier, at 1.5x speed and the ego at 1.2x, the policy failed in nearly every repeat (S26). Even so, the bottom of its 90% range only touches the 0.5 threshold, so it is not confirmed. These failures don't come from the retimed car. On an open highway the policy braked hard for no visible reason, drifted left and clipped a passing car in the left lane. The other leads are weak: a single failure of the same leftward-drift kind on 096988dd (S5), and failures on 1c45ce3a (S33) where it's unclear whether the policy was to blame. At every other setting no run failed, but most of those settings ran only once or twice, so the policy has not been shown safe there either.",
