    "claim": "Scene 19f339ba, with the car 2 s earlier, at 1.5x speed and the ego at 1.2x, is the strongest candidate. It failed in nearly every repeat, but the 90% range only reaches the 0.5 threshold, so it is not confirmed. Every failure there was the policy's fault: it braked hard from about 20 to 8 m/s with nothing close ahead, drifted left and hit a car passing in the left lane (actor 1, not the retimed car 18). None of these failures is a possible rendering artifact.",
